  "decision_summary": "The query combines an N-benzylpiperidine group with a dimethoxy-aromatic tetralone core, and multiple high-transfer analogues with direct in vivo brain-uptake or brain/plasma measurements demonstrate good CNS access. The low-transfer negative records are structurally and contextually distant and do not override this consistent positive evidence.",
